// CotSC: English translation extracted from bg0119_three_old_kegs.d
// Original English strings preserved exactly. Translate text inside ~...~ only.

@1 = ~Welcome. How can I be of assistance?~
@2 = ~I'd like a drink.~
@3 = ~Tell me about this place.~
@4 = ~I'll be going.~
@5 = ~Please, see Nantrin for service. I have a few orders to take already. He is free at the moment as I see.~
@6 = ~The Three Old Kegs is one of the oldest taverns in Baldur's Gate. Never thought I'd be working somewhere this fancy! Nantrin Bellowglym runs this place.~
@7 = ~What can I get you?~
@8 = ~Let' see what you have.~
@9 = ~Nothing~
